WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.627
Developers add a data source by implementing IReportDataSource.

00:00:07.627 --> 00:00:12.631
It lists its data sets, describes their fields, and returns rows for the

00:00:12.631 --> 00:00:14.620
fields a report asks for.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:22.979
For data kept in records, derive from ReportRecordDataSource, and register the source with the service collection.

00:00:22.979 --> 00:00:26.150
The source decides what each person may see.

